        <mxCell id="p3_footer" value="&lt;b&gt;Key points&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Keycloak federates corporate SSO via OIDC and the enterprise directory via LDAP. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ② Keycloak authenticates Coder, Manager, and Grafana; infrastructure-managed Apigee also authenticates Manager via OIDC. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ③ HAProxy Basic Auth protects only Flower and Prometheus after TLS termination." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#0F172A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=22;spacingRight=22;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
