        <mxCell id="p4_footer" value="&lt;b&gt;Architecture rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Redis is ephemeral with no PVC. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ② Celery runs internal jobs. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ③ The Python API uses Keycloak and Apigee via OIDC. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ④ Only the Python API calls Argo CD. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ⑤ Flower monitors Celery; it does not control it." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#0F172A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=22;spacingRight=22;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
