        <mxCell id="p5_footer" value="&lt;b&gt;Key points&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Argo CD deploys each logical 1:1 WAF + Coder unit and stops at the central cluster. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ② The WAF only filters Coder product traffic; it never provisions Workspaces. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ③ Each Coder calls its dedicated cluster’s Kubernetes API directly. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ④ Manager never provisions workspace pods." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#0F172A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=22;spacingRight=22;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
