        <mxCell id="p6w_footer" value="&lt;b&gt;Key decisions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Workspace access uses the Coder web page or Coder-provided access proxy (add-on / CLI) and the established agent tunnel; no direct user ingress exists. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ② AI-capable callers use the in-house AI Gateway; no direct provider path is shown. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ③ The gateway requires trusted identity, approved Workload source IP/CIDR, and rate limiting. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ④ Identity proof, source preservation, quota, and provider details remain implementation contracts. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ⑤ GPU use is available only when the Workload cluster exposes GPU-capable nodes." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#0F172A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=22;spacingRight=22;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
