        <mxCell id="p7s_footer" value="&lt;b&gt;Key decisions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Two storage capabilities are available in every external Workload cluster. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ② Local Path uses XFS quota enforcement; NFS is delivered through Trident. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ③ Selection is made per workload need; no default, fallback, or automatic migration is implied. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ④ These profiles are independent of the central Trident PVCs used by Prometheus and Grafana." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#0F172A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=22;spacingRight=22;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
